# Fix E2BIG: BLEND via file when shard count is large

> 补丁类型：手动修改（两个文件在不同目录，非 git apply）
> 修改文件：2 个
> flag-off = stock：BLEND < 100KB 时走原路径，零回归

---

## 文件 1: code/baize-llm/scripts/train.sh

### 修改点 A：在 BLEND 变量赋值后，添加文件写入逻辑

找到（约 L88-89）：
  BLEND="$(cat "$BLENDFILE")"; rm -f "$BLENDFILE"
  log "blend 就绪：$(echo "$BLEND" | wc -w | awk '{print $1/2}') 个 shard（权重+前缀对）"

在其后添加：

  # ---------- E2BIG fix: write BLEND to file if too long for argv ----------
  BLEND_FILE=""
  if [ "$(printf '%s' "$BLEND" | wc -c)" -gt 100000 ]; then
    BLEND_FILE="$BAIZE_TRAIN_CODE/blend_runtime.txt"
    printf '%s' "$BLEND" > "$BLEND_FILE"
    log "blend 字符串 >100KB，写入文件: $BLEND_FILE ($(wc -c < "$BLEND_FILE") bytes)"
  fi

### 修改点 B：ARGS 中的 --train-data-path

找到（约 L100-101）：
  ARGS=( --arch "$ARCH" --name "$NAME" --dir "$EXP_ROOT"
         --tokenizer-path "$TOKENIZER" --train-data-path "$BLEND"

替换为：
  if [ -n "$BLEND_FILE" ]; then
    _TDP="@$BLEND_FILE"
  else
    _TDP="$BLEND"
  fi
  ARGS=( --arch "$ARCH" --name "$NAME" --dir "$EXP_ROOT"
         --tokenizer-path "$TOKENIZER" --train-data-path "$_TDP"

---

## 文件 2: code/BaiZe-ISEDA2027/pretrain_launcher.py

### 修改点：normalize --train-data-path 逻辑

找到（约 L281-286）：
  if args.train_data_path:
      _flat = []
      for _elem in args.train_data_path:
          _flat.extend(_elem.split())
      args.train_data_path = _flat

替换为：
  if args.train_data_path:
      _flat = []
      for _elem in args.train_data_path:
          # E2BIG fix: if element starts with "@", read blend from file
          if _elem.startswith('@') and os.path.isfile(_elem[1:]):
              with open(_elem[1:], 'r') as _bf:
                  _flat.extend(_bf.read().split())
              if _rank == 0:
                  print(f"[blend] Loaded {len(_flat)//2} shard entries from {_elem[1:]}", flush=True)
              continue
          _flat.extend(_elem.split())
      args.train_data_path = _flat

